# Code Owners for OpenTAMS
#
# Defines the reviewers automatically requested on a pull request.
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Roster: MAINTAINERS.md. Review thresholds: GOVERNANCE.md.
#
# Every maintainer owns the whole tree. GOVERNANCE.md asks for one approval on
# any change, so a per-path split would only decide which name the request
# lands on, at the cost of blocking a path on one person's availability. The
# request goes to the whole group and any one of them can approve it.

